        <h1>Bitcoin Transaction Decoder</h1>

        <p>Decode a <strong>Bitcoin transaction</strong> by entering its transaction hash or raw transaction hex.
            The tool analyzes supported legacy P2PKH inputs and checks their <strong>ECDSA signatures</strong> for
            repeated R-values that may indicate nonce reuse.</p>

